    {
      "category": "overview",
      "field": "programme_description",
      "value": "Arizona State University’s online Bachelor of Science in health sciences with a concentration in healthy lifestyles and fitness science is designed for those who are passionate about the lifestyle-based aspects of health and wellness. By combining the study of exercise and nutrition with human behavior and motivation, this program provides you with a solid background in preventative health care and prepares you for certification in the top health and wellness fields. Upon graduation, you can work in clinical settings, private or community-based organizations or as an entrepreneur.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": {
