    {
      "category": "overview",
      "field": "programme_description",
      "value": "In your core courses, you’ll build knowledge on healthy eating, cultural influences on health and using artificial intelligence in health settings. In your track, your courses will hone in on specific areas of health and wellness. Topics may include diabetes prevention, sexual health, social media and health, behavior change methodologies, coaching communication, fitness programming and more. To culminate the program, you’ll also participate in hands-on, experiential learning.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": {
        "source_type": "program",
        "url": ""
